--        NT:     none warranted distinct (the vow-kept movement is a Tanakh/Torah arc; the worship-by-faith of Jacob is Heb 11:21 but that names the Gen 48 blessing, not the Bethel return — not forced)
--        Extras: Jubilees 31:1 (Purify yourselves and change your garments, and let us arise and go up to Bethel, where I vowed a vow to Him on the day when I fled from the face of Esau); Jasher 36:1 (Arise, go to Bethel and remain there, and make there an altar to Yahuah who appears to you) — THREAD 2
