--        NT:     2 Corinthians 7:1 (let us cleanse ourselves from all filthiness of the flesh and spirit, perfecting holiness); 2 Corinthians 6:17 (come out from among them, and be ye separate, saith Yahuah, and touch not the unclean thing); 1 John 5:21 (Little children, keep yourselves from idols) — THREAD 1
--        Extras: Jubilees 31:1-2 (put you away the strange gods that are among you... the idols which Rachel stole from Laban... he burnt and brake them to pieces and destroyed them, and hid them under an oak) — THREAD 1
