-- Threads (slug — target libraries):
--   1. genesis-35-put-away-the-strange-gods-and-be-clean — NT (2 Corinthians, 1 John) + Tanakh (Genesis 31) + Extras (Jubilees) [extras] (★ cleanse, come out, keep from idols; the teraphim buried)
--   2. genesis-35-go-up-to-bethel-the-vow-kept-el-bethel — Tanakh (Genesis 28) + Extras (Jubilees, Jasher) [extras] (★ the vow of Gen 28 paid; El-beth-el)
--   3. genesis-35-thy-name-shall-be-yasharel-reaffirmed — Tanakh (Genesis 32) + Extras (Jubilees, Jasher) [extras] (★ the wrestling-name sealed by Elohim)
